<title>JAPAN: Heiwa Real Estate to issue 10 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Heiwa Real Estate to issue 10 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Heiwa Real Estate Co Ltd</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Nikko Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p> TRUSTEE - Sakura Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   4	  AMT   10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 29.Mar.02</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Apr.97   CONV TO 28.Mar.02</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 12.Mar.97  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 4.Mar-10.Mar</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on March 3.</p>
</text>
